    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Irradiation applied to seeds using ionizing or non-ionizing radiation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Integration touchpoint suggestion: align to external ontology class 'SeedTreatment' via skos:closeMatch.</rdfs:comment>
